  "body": "This home has been designed to make family life easier, with flexible living spaces, excellent parking and lifestyle amenities - a combination that's not easy to find.\r\n\r\nKey features:\r\n• Four bedrooms and two bathrooms\r\n• Two separate living areas\r\n• Double internal access garage\r\n• Generous off-street parking\r\n• Shared pool, spa and tennis court\r\n• Solid brick construction\r\n• No body corporate\r\n\r\nFor some, it'll be the multiple living spaces; for others, it'll be the parking, the pool or the tennis court. The only way to know if it's the right fit for your family is to come and take a look for yourself at one of our open homes or contact me for a private viewing.",
